  m_Name: PancitPusitDishReflection
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dishName: Pancit Pusit
  dishSprite: {fileID: 0}
  pages:
  - 'Impressive work. The plate in front of you carries the signature of three culinary
    worlds. '
  - Spain gave you the squid-ink technique, carried in through three centuries of
    naval and clerical cuisine.
  - 'China gave you the noodles and the stir-fry. '
  - The Philippines gave you the fresh squid, the Manila Bay fishery, and the calamansi
    finish.
  - Only Cavite City, with its unique colonial history, could have brought the three
    together in one dish.
  - "When you order \u201Cpancit choca\u201D by its old name, you are speaking a
    word in three languages at once. "
